This directory is Bootstrap's Sass source, vendored verbatim from upstream.
Do not hand-edit it: changes would silently diverge from upstream with no record.

  version: Bootstrap 5.3.3 (see the banner in bootstrap.scss)
  source:  node_modules/bootstrap/scss/* from `npm install bootstrap@<version>`

Which partials the site actually compiles is decided in assets/main.scss, not
here -- the full bootstrap.scss import is deliberately not used. Put overrides
in _sass/SHB_css.scss instead.
